Hi,

I'm observing local dependence between 2 items in a measure that I'd like to model. I'm wondering how you can model the residual correlations between the two variables in MIRT? I had tried to switch to lavaan, but the item difficulty estimates between the two programs are not comparable in magnitude, so I'd like to find a MIRT solution. Thanks for any guidance.

B

