Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Residual correlations are equivalent to adding a new orthogonal factor that loads only on two (or more) items that have residual correlations. For two-loading patterns though, you'd need to constrain their slopes to equal for identification purposes. HTH.

Phil

